      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 26,
      "title": {
        "en": "Caring and knowledgeable clinic staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary team at PetWellClinic East Greenway for their compassionate, gentle, and informative approach. Visitors highlight that the veterinarians and assistants take time to answer questions and keep nervous dogs and cats calm during exams. Many clients note feeling confident in the care provided."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable and transparent veterinary fees"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently emphasize that prices for consultations, routine shots, and basic lab tests are significantly lower than traditional animal hospitals. Several pet parents highlight clear package options that make preventive care accessible without hidden fees. While one visitor noted an evaluation charge, overall feedback on affordability is exceptionally positive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fast walk-in service without appointments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the convenient walk-in model that allows pets to be seen quickly without scheduling days in advance. Many reviewers report minimal waiting times upon arrival, with several in and out within thirty to forty minutes. This flexibility is highlighted as especially helpful for sudden minor illnesses and routine pet vaccinations."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does PetWellClinic East Greenway accept walk-ins?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the clinic operates on a walk-in basis, allowing pets to receive examinations and routine care without an advance appointment."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are the clinic fees affordable compared to full-service hospitals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients consistently highlight that routine examinations, vaccination packages, and lab tests are significantly less expensive than traditional emergency or surgical hospitals."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can pets receive treatments for minor urgent issues here?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers mention receiving prompt walk-in care for minor skin irritations, sudden ear problems, and routine outpatient treatments."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic perform complex surgeries?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "No, PetWellClinic focuses on outpatient preventive care, vaccinations, minor illness treatments, and lab tests, referring surgical cases to full-service hospitals."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    }
